OL,3,GNEWSA'Nationally significant' solar
OL,4,Afarm plan approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a major solar farm classed as
OL,7,F"nationally significant infrastructure"
OL,8,Fhas been approved by the government's
OL,9,FPlanning Inspectorate.
OL,11,FThe Great North Road Solar and
OL,12,FBiodiversity Park, near Newark in
OL,13,FNottinghamshire, has the potential to
OL,14,Fpower up to 400,000 homes - the
OL,15,Fequivalent of every home in the county
OL,16,F- developers Elements Green previously
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
