OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Nationally significant' solar
OL,4,Afarm plan approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project would form a ring of "solar
OL,7,Fislands" roughly 6.2 miles (10km) from
OL,8,Fnorth to south around villages such as
OL,9,FCaunton and Ossington, with the eastern
OL,10,Fedge alongside the A1.
OL,12,FFinal approval was given by Baroness
OL,13,FMargaret Curran on behalf of the
OL,14,Fsecretary of state for energy security
OL,15,Fand net-zero.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
